  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "印刷工場を買い取る  (Buying the Printing Factory)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "kawada": "川田",
    "keieisha": "経営者"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Fresh from the studio shoot, Muranishi tells Kawada why every project needs a real story, then brings him straight to Yoshikawa's printing factory. When the cautious proprietor refuses to print for them, Kawada and Muranishi offer to buy the entire factory in cash. Listen to the rhythm of the negotiation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "脳を刺激するストーリーが必要なんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "作りたいものを作りにですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どうしても無理ですかね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "では、この工場を買い取ります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "無理な話だよ。資金が足りないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "問屋は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろん挟まない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "一カ月以内に買えますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "即金で五千万出しますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "ちょっと幹部連中と話してきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ずっと待ってました、あなたのような人を。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いけます！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Business numbers and bold promises drive this negotiation at Yoshikawa's factory. Let's break down each turn.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "脳を刺激するストーリーが必要なんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You need a story that stimulates the mind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "作りたいものを作りにですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To go make what we want to make.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どうしても無理ですかね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is it really impossible no matter what?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "では、この工場を買い取ります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then we will buy out this factory.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "無理な話だよ。資金が足りないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is an impossible idea. You do not have enough funds.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "問屋は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What about wholesalers?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろん挟まない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course we leave them out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "一カ月以内に買えますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We can buy it within one month.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "即金で五千万出しますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will pay fifty million right now in cash.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "ちょっと幹部連中と話してきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will go talk with the executives for a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ずっと待ってました、あなたのような人を。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have been waiting all along for someone like you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いけます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This will work!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "脳を刺激するストーリーが必要なんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "作りたいものを作りにですよ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "どうしても無理ですかね？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "では、この工場を買い取ります。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "無理な話だよ。資金が足りないよ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
